# The Data Payload in /payload/ and the Golden Traces in /traces/ are tracked, on
# purpose (ADR 0029); the app built from them is published from this repository
# (ADR 0093).

# Supplied reference media remain research inputs, not repository content. The one
# tracked documentation exception is research/reference-disassembly (ADR 0017).
/roms

# Other Restricted Material that does not belong to a specific research harness.
/restricted/

